    "title": "Crash claims life of Wilmer man - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kim Lanier-Hunt ,\n7 hours ago MOBILE COUNTY, Ala. (WALA) - A two-vehicle crash Tuesday night claimed the life of a motorcyclist, according to the Alabama Law Enforcement Agency. James R. Parker, 38, of Wilmer, was critically injured when a Nissan Pathfinder driven by a 45-year-old Semmes woman, hit his Harley-Davidson FXBR, ALEA said. Parker was thrown from the motorcycle. He was taken to a local hospital, where he died, ALEA said. Read full article",
